
EXERCISE 8: WHOIS Lookup
Date: 18. Aug.2026
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Aim: To study and perform WHOIS lookup to gather domain registration information.
Tools Required: Kali Linux terminal, WHOIS utility, internet connection.
Theory:
WHOIS is a query and response protocol used to query databases that store registered users
of domain names, IP addresses, and autonomous systems. It provides:
 Domain registrar
 Registration and expiry dates
 Name servers
 Registrant contact information
 Administrative and technical contacts
Procedure:
1. Check if WHOIS is installed:
whois --version
If not installed:
sudo apt install whois
2. Perform WHOIS lookup:
whois example.com
3. Look up IP address:
whois 93.184.216.34
4. Save output:
whois example.com > whois_output.txt
